{"title":"Photo Towels","description":"\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/other-photo-gifts\"\u003eAll Other\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/photo-towels\"\u003eTowels\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/photo-scarves-ties\"\u003eScarves \u0026amp; Ties\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/products\/personalized-photo-mousepad\"\u003eMousepads\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"photo-collage-beach-towel-30-x-60","title":"Photo Quick Collage Beach Towel -6 Image Template- 30\" x 60\"","description":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA towel unlike what you're used to – made from absorbent microfiber, this soft and plush towel is thinner than a normal terrycloth towel, but dries you off just as well! A perfect gift for the spring and summer months.  This option allows you to quickly and easily set up a 6 image collage using our template and your images!\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e30\" x 60\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eMicrofiber Polyester\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cem\u003e(Thinner than Terrycloth)\u003c\/em\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eDye Sublimation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eShips in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSoftness Index:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eSuper Soft\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"font-size: 12px;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eNOTE: The \"Collage Border\" area of any quick collage layout must be filled with a background color or pattern fill of some kind and canno